Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the portal code only: index.html, config.js,
worker.js and build_index.py.

It does not cover the standards content. The clause text in clauses.js and the
images in figures/ are extracted from the Design Manual for Roads and Bridges
and the Manual of Contract Documents for Highway Works. That content is
Crown copyright, published by National Highways, and is re-used under the
Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/
Logos are excluded from that licence.
